WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:15.875 --> 00:00:17.166
See, look here, DeMar

00:00:17.541 --> 00:00:18.625
Draymond’s on LeBron again...

00:00:18.625 --> 00:00:20.666
Yeah, it’s like a triple switch or something

00:00:20.666 --> 00:00:21.166
Exactly...

00:00:21.166 --> 00:00:21.916
What are you reading?

00:00:22.416 --> 00:00:23.541
We’re studying.

00:00:23.541 --> 00:00:26.208
House Warriors' defensive tactics against King James

00:00:26.208 --> 00:00:28.000
It wasn’t their tactics.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.083
It was their talent. 

00:00:29.083 --> 00:00:30.208
We have the talent.

00:00:30.208 --> 00:00:31.750
We just need smart strategy

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.791
and for the gods to finally smile on us.

00:00:33.791 --> 00:00:35.208
Maybe they have

00:00:36.916 --> 00:00:38.416
DeMar! This is our chance!

00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:40.708
King James is gone from our path,

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:43.083
but he is also gone from our excuses.

00:00:43.083 --> 00:00:45.375
If we fail to conquer the East this year…

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:48.000
it could be the end for all of us.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.750
My lord, you have always believed in us

00:00:49.750 --> 00:00:51.833
We will reward your faith. I swear it

00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.291
I’m afraid faith is not enough

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.666
Here we pay a Northern price for a blessing

00:00:59.666 --> 00:01:01.791
The gods demand a sacrifice

00:01:03.166 --> 00:01:06.541
Lord Ujiri, I pledge that I will do whatever it takes

00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:08.625
Yes. We’d give anything for The Six

00:01:08.625 --> 00:01:09.500
I know

00:01:13.666 --> 00:01:15.708
Forgive me

00:01:19.083 --> 00:01:20.958
Kyle! Wake up! Kyle! Kyle!

00:01:20.958 --> 00:01:21.958
Norman? 

00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:22.583
What are you doing—

00:01:22.583 --> 00:01:24.416
It’s a trade. We’re making a trade.

00:01:24.416 --> 00:01:25.166
A trade? 

00:01:25.166 --> 00:01:26.666
Why didn’t anyone tell me?

00:01:26.666 --> 00:01:27.375
Well...you know...

00:01:27.375 --> 00:01:29.000
you did trade for a horse once...

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.708
and I think Lord Ujiri doesn’t include you

00:01:30.708 --> 00:01:32.000
Ugh! He’s so annoying!

00:01:32.625 --> 00:01:33.916
Excuse me. Excuse me! 

00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:36.250
Get out of my way

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:38.125
No...no...no...

00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:38.875
Kyle! 

00:01:38.875 --> 00:01:40.250
Don’t let them do it

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:40.916
I won’t

00:01:40.916 --> 00:01:42.583
This must be some sort of mistake—

00:01:42.583 --> 00:01:46.125
He was here for a long time, not a good time

00:01:46.125 --> 00:01:48.250
What? Where’s Lord Ujiri?

00:01:48.250 --> 00:01:49.625
It will all be over soon

00:01:49.625 --> 00:01:51.375
No! I demand to see Lord Ujiri!

00:01:51.375 --> 00:01:53.375
Where is Lord Ujiri??? 

00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:55.791
My Lord…you can’t! 

00:01:55.791 --> 00:01:57.083
You said you wouldn’t!

00:01:57.083 --> 00:01:57.875
Gods’ plan

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.000
Drake, have you all gone mad?

00:02:01.000 --> 00:02:02.416
If we don’t make a trade,

00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:03.916
there will be no banners here.

00:02:03.916 --> 00:02:05.625
Oh, is that what they said at House Thunder

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:07.083
when they traded away James Harden?

00:02:07.083 --> 00:02:08.458
Ah, man. That’s not the same!

00:02:08.458 --> 00:02:11.375
Silver Lord, bless this trade,

00:02:11.375 --> 00:02:13.916
for it is fair and for the good of the Realm!

00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:16.083
How could you do this to your most loyal knight?

00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:17.375
Not just him

00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:21.291
Also Jake—Jakob…Pole-tull... 

00:02:21.291 --> 00:02:25.458
Po-ull-tull... Poyttle... Pelt-el...

00:02:26.166 --> 00:02:27.291
Him!

00:02:27.291 --> 00:02:28.625
Hello!

00:02:30.375 --> 00:02:33.166
All right, summon the Trade Raptor!

00:02:59.791 --> 00:03:03.500
Ah! Ah! Ahhh!! No! Noooo!!!!

00:03:03.500 --> 00:03:04.958
Bye, Jacob Poortle!

00:03:04.958 --> 00:03:06.375
It's Jakob Poeltl

00:03:06.375 --> 00:03:08.291
Please. I’ll do whatever you ask.

00:03:08.291 --> 00:03:09.375
I’ll shoot more threes!

00:03:09.375 --> 00:03:11.833
Lord Ujiri! How could you do this? 

00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:13.166
He’s my best friend!

00:03:13.166 --> 00:03:15.250
It’s OK. I’ll be your new best friend.

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.208
Shush, Norman!

00:03:16.208 --> 00:03:18.083
Kyle...please

00:03:18.083 --> 00:03:19.666
Is there any other way?

00:03:19.666 --> 00:03:21.625
We tried. They didn’t want you.

00:03:21.625 --> 00:03:24.625
Please! Please! I'll try on defense!

00:03:24.625 --> 00:03:26.041
I’ll shoot it from anywhere

00:03:26.041 --> 00:03:28.375
I’ll shoot it from behind half court

00:03:28.375 --> 00:03:31.041
No! No! No! No! Please! Please!

00:03:34.208 --> 00:03:34.916
Hi, DeMar!

00:03:34.916 --> 00:03:36.083
Oh, hi, Jakob

00:03:38.875 --> 00:03:41.000
Wait…WAIT. WAIT!

00:03:42.166 --> 00:03:43.583
I almost forgot

00:03:44.250 --> 00:03:46.333
We also owe them a first-round pick

00:03:47.416 --> 00:03:48.416
Ow. Oh, come on

00:03:48.541 --> 00:03:50.166
OK. We’re good. We should be good

00:03:50.166 --> 00:03:53.500
Trade Raptor, take these knights to their new house

00:03:53.500 --> 00:03:55.916
Wait. DeMar AND a pick?

00:03:55.916 --> 00:03:57.416
And Jake Puddle

00:03:57.416 --> 00:03:58.833
Argh, get off me!

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:05.875
No! Please, come back! No!

00:04:08.416 --> 00:04:10.625
My friend...

00:04:10.625 --> 00:04:12.250
Well, whoever we’re getting back…

00:04:12.875 --> 00:04:14.958
he’d better be a bloody monster! 

